# Shiva Velpula
## Senior Cloud, DevOps, SRE & AI/MLOps Engineer

I design, automate, and operate secure cloud-native platforms for large-scale workloads. My work spans Azure infrastructure, Kubernetes platform engineering, CI/CD, Infrastructure as Code, observability, and AI/ML operations.

I focus on turning complex operational challenges into reusable automation, dependable delivery workflows, and scalable developer platforms.

### Professional Summary
- Build and operate secure, resilient cloud platforms on Microsoft Azure
- Design and manage Kubernetes and OpenShift environments for production workloads
- Implement CI/CD and GitOps pipelines for reliable software delivery
- Automate infrastructure and environment provisioning using Terraform, Bicep, and ARM
- Improve system reliability through SRE practices, monitoring, and incident response
- Deliver production-ready AI and LLM solutions with MLOps and AI observability

